<title>USA: Acindar Industria sets $100 mln in notes.</title>
<headline>Acindar Industria sets $100 mln in notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue from Acindar Industria Argentina de Aceros SA was priced on Friday, according to lead manager Credit Suisse First Boston Corp.</p>
<p>BORROWER ACINDAR INDUSTRIA ARGENTINA DE ACEROS SA</p>
<p>AMT $100 MLN	 COUPON 11.25 PCT  MATURITY 2/15/2004</p>
<p>TYPE NOTES	   ISS PRICE 100.00  FIRST PAY DATE 8/15/1997</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S B2    YIELD 11.25 PCT   PAY FREQ  SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P B-PLUS    SPREAD 491 BPS    CALLABLE  NON-CALL FIVE</p>
<p>((U.S. corporate bond unit, 212 859-1678))</p>
